! Revival build settings missing from the selected archived steering fragment.
! These are guest compiler settings, independent of the native host ABI.
! NO is zero in the archived HOSTCODES catalogue.
!
! CRCALL in timp06s explains the optional early evaluation of nested calls.
! ibmgen05s -> CALL COMING and CALL MADE save/restore FPHEAD, FPPTR and
! LAST PAR REG, supporting nested calls without the optional extra pass.
! This is the revival default, not a recovered historical declaration.
%constantinteger UNNESTCALLS=0
!
! compiler_standards.mss 4b: IBM record value parameters are stacked.
%constantinteger RECVALINWA=0
! IBM values occupy positive offsets beyond GR11; CALL COMING advances WSPR.
%constantinteger STACKDOWN=0
